  beats:
  - title: Abandoned but not Forgotten
    text: 'A VR field trip to the machines NASA left behind.


      Your first stop:
      Mars. Opportunity was designed for 90 sols and worked for nearly 15 years.
      It last communicated with Earth on June 10, 2018. Find out what it discovered
      and how it got there.


      NASA Space Apps 2026. Team: Yayo, Gibson, Dominic,
      Susan.'
